                                "sense_id": "f5cdd2db-7a5c-3cc2-901d-e62bb568eb4e",
                                "text": "Art. 22. In case of inability on the part of the offender to pay such mulet, or any part thereof,—power to the Judge , to commit him or her to prison for such term […]"
                            },
